instantly, but tap through a confirmation first. Enough friction to break the reflex.\nMedium Lock — wait 5 minutes before access is granted. Enough time to actually reconsider.\nHard Lock — you cannot unblock it yourself. Your buddy gets a notification and decides whether to let you in. No workarounds. No escape hatch.\n\nTHE BUDDY SYSTEM\n\nThis is what makes Disconnect App different from every other screen time blocker.\n\nYou choose someone you trust — a friend, a partner, anyone. When you try to open a hard-locked app, they receive a notification and approve or deny in seconds. It's not surveillance. It's accountability. One person who steps in when your willpower gives out.\n\nYour buddy never sees which apps you use or how long you spend on them. They simply get asked: yes or no?\n\nWHAT'S FREE\n\n· 1 rule\n· 1 buddy\n· All three lock levels including hard lock\n· No time limit — it's yours to keep\n\nDISCONNECT PRO\n\n· Unlimited rules\n· Multiple buddies\n· More features coming\n\nPRIVACY & LEGAL\n\nDisconnect App uses Apple's Screen Time API. The apps you choose to block never leave your device — we never see them. Only the minimum data needed to run the buddy system is stored: your display name, buddy relationships, and unlock requests. We do not sell your data.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://disconnectapp.co/privacy\nTerms of Service: https://disconnectapp.co/terms", "sellerUrl": "https://disconnectapp.co", "minimumOsVersion": "16.0", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "32607232", "formattedPrice": "무료", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "trackContentRating": "4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "artistId": 1710448517, "artistName": "Bytehood", "genres": ["생산성", "건강 및 피트니스"], "userRatingCount": 0}]}